	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div xml:id="div1" corresp="regest1">
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>Tametsi fortassis impudentior sim toties literis tibi occupatissimo, <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>ut in quem non nisi gravissima et ardua recumbant, obstrependo, <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>nedum ut literas reposcam, quod tantum non impium foret, <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>nolui tamen clam te esse libellum<note xml:id="fn1" type="footnote" n="1">Die Schmalkaldischen Artikel; vgl. <bibl source="b10">HBBW VIII</bibl>, S. 292, 29-31.</note> a <persName ref="p1974">Luthero</persName> editum plerosque <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>hic sobrie sentientes commovisse usque eo, ut res ad senatum <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>diacosiosque<note xml:id="fn2" type="footnote" n="2">d. h. an den Kleinen und den Großen Rat.</note> relata salubrem et plausibilem sententiam - <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>insperato, opera tamen fidelium et cordatorum - extorserit, <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>talem videlicet, nos certo deprehendere parum nobis cum <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>isto articulo de sacramento<pb type="edition" next="41"/> altaris iuxta verba <persName ref="p1974">Lutheri</persName> <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>convenire posse propemodumque suspectos esse, qui se <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>intercedendo interposuerint<note xml:id="fn3" type="footnote" n="3"><persName ref="p467">Bucer</persName> und <persName ref="p5565">Capito</persName>.</note>, quorum tamen nomina studio <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>supprimebantur.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Sed quicquid hactenus de his actum sit, <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>utcunque nos ad concordiam applicuerimus et utcunque <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>posthac concordię negotium cedat, nos tamen velle <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>manere circa sensum et verba disputationis nostrę<note xml:id="fn4" type="footnote" n="4">Gemeint ist die <placeName ref="l41">Berner</placeName> Disputation von 1528, insbesondere deren vierte Schlußrede (s. <bibl source="b9">HBBW VII</bibl> <ref target="file11088">[Nr. 1045]</ref>, S. 247, Anm. 21).</note> <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>et responso <persName ref="p1974">Luthero</persName> transmisso<note xml:id="fn5" type="footnote" n="5">Zu erwarten wäre ein Genetiv. - Die Rede ist vom Schreiben der reformierten Städte der Eidgenossenschaft an <persName ref="p1974">Luther</persName> vom 12. Januar 1537 (<bibl source="b671">WA</bibl> Briefwechsel XII 241-275, Nr. 4268).</note> neque quicquam aliud <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>a quoquam vel audire vel admittere et in isto <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>gratiam dei expectare, confidentes deum nobis non defore, <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>quicquid interim principes quicunque moliantur etc.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z20"/>Plura libenter scriberem, sed mihi non est otium iam.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z21"/>Profuerit meo iuditio apologiam adornari, ut nostra <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>innocentia mundo constaret universo, remque per <lb xml:id="p1z23"/>legatos magistratus vosque nobiscum expediendam.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z24"/>Promptos nos invenietis vobis in nullo defuturos etc.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z25"/>Mitto quaedam a <persName ref="p5837">Sebastiano</persName><note xml:id="fn6" type="footnote" n="6"><persName ref="p5837">Sebastian Meyer</persName>.</note>, quae mittenda commendavit et <lb xml:id="p1z26"/>ad Apocalypsim excudenda<note xml:id="fna" type="footnote" n="a"><hi>in der Vorlage</hi> excudan.</note><note xml:id="fn7" type="footnote" n="7">Bei dieser Beilage könnte es sich um <persName ref="p5837">Meyers</persName> Nachwort zu seinem Apokalypsenkommentar gehandelt haben; vgl. <bibl source="b10">HBBW VIII</bibl>, <ref target="file11200">Nr. 1157</ref>, 1-13, und 1207, 1-15, sowie unten <ref target="file11267">Nr. 1224</ref>, 8-28.</note>, si nondum finita; lege <lb xml:id="p1z27"/>et fac pro tuo candore vel remitte, si Apocalipsis fini<lb xml:id="p1z28"/>ta etc.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">Habe me commendatum, quęso; saluta <lb xml:id="p1z30"/><persName ref="p8127">Pellicanum</persName>, <persName ref="p8412">Megandrum</persName>, <lb xml:id="p1z31"/><persName ref="p8171">Theodorum</persName><note xml:id="fn8" type="footnote" n="8"><persName ref="p8171">Theodor Bibliander</persName>.</note>, <persName ref="p8428">Rhellicanum</persName>, <lb xml:id="p1z32"/><persName ref="p167">Ammianum</persName><note xml:id="fn9" type="footnote" n="9"><persName ref="p167">Johann Jakob Ammann</persName>.</note>, <persName ref="p4554">Clivanum</persName><note xml:id="fn10" type="footnote" n="10"><persName ref="p4554">Rudolf Collin</persName>.</note>, <persName ref="p344">Binderum</persName>, in summa singulos <lb xml:id="p1z33"/>et <persName ref="p8447">Steinerum</persName> etc.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">Datum raptim, <placeName ref="l41">Bernę</placeName>, in <lb xml:id="p1z34"/>senatu scripta, 25. ianuarii anno 1539.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z35"/><persName ref="p20015">Cuntzenus</persName><note xml:id="fn11" type="footnote" n="11"><persName ref="p8401">Peter Kunz</persName>.</note>, <persName ref="p5837">Sebastianus</persName> et <persName ref="p3099">Sultzerus</persName> libent<lb xml:id="p1z36"/>er fulminarent, si modo auderent, mihique non <lb xml:id="p1z38"/>parum infensi, quod minus videar partes suas tue<lb xml:id="p1z39"/>ri; sed causa mala patrocinio non digna etc.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la">Hoc in sinum tuum <lb xml:id="p1z40"/>dictum sit; nisi destiterint, apertas simultates non <lb xml:id="p1z41"/>exhorrescam, cum homo durus et rusticus sim.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z42"/>Tuus <persName ref="p3700">Eberardus a Rümlang</persName>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<note type="address">[Adresse auf der Rückseite:]</note>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>Eruditissimo et vigilantissimo viro <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>domino <persName ref="p495">Henrico Bullingero</persName>, ecclesię <lb xml:id="p2z3"/><placeName ref="l587">Tigurinę</placeName> ecclesiastae primario, <lb xml:id="p2z4"/>domino suo observando.</s>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="de"><lb xml:id="p2z5"/>An Meister <persName ref="p495">Heinrich <lb xml:id="p2z6"/>Bullinger</persName>.</s>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="de"><placeName ref="l587">Zürich</placeName>.</s>
				</p>
